      <title>放弃买房转租房投资：中国人如何用“rent and invest”积累退休金</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E4%B9%B0%E6%88%BF%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%9F%E6%88%BF%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%94%A8rent-and-invest%E7%A7%AF%E7%B4%AF%E9%80%80%E4%BC%91%E9%87%91/</link>
